  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PROJECT:CHALLENGING GENDER-BASED VIOLENCE IN EDUCATION OF GIRLS IN 3 DE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AAMoz will be implementing the project Desafiando a Viol&#xea;ncia Baseada no G&#xe9;nero na Educa&#xe7;&#xe3;o de Raparigas e Mulheres jovens da Posto Administrativo de 3 de Fevereiro no distrito da Manhi&#xe7;a in Maputo province. The project aims to contribute to prevent and reduce incidents of GBV in education and premature unions, with a view to retain and return girls to school until they complete basic education, including promoting life skills for girls outside of school.</narrative>
  </description>
